{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_10117110","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10117110","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1011711001:0":{"text":"Hmph... The one responsible for the corruption is right here in front of you, and yet you're holding back?","source_cn":"哼……明明腐化丛林的罪魁祸首就在眼前，反而不出手了么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x380EDFFAD15F6421","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1011711001":{"text":"Hmph... The one responsible for the corruption is right here in front of you, and yet you're holding back?","source_cn":"哼……明明腐化丛林的罪魁祸首就在眼前，反而不出手了么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x380EDFFAD15F6421","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1011711002:0":{"text":"Young mage, don't try to use your limited knowledge to underestimate an immortal <style=\"highlight\">Graveborn</style>.","source_cn":"年轻的魔法师，你要用自己有限的知识来揣测永恒的<sty...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x900A31D184026E9B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Young mage, don't try to use your limited knowledge to underestimate an immortal <style=\"highlight\">Graveborn</style>.","female":"Young mage, don't try to use your limited knowledge to underestimate an immortal <style=\"highlight\">Graveborn</style>.","variant_male_record_index":"107924","variant_female_record_index":"107925","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1011711003:0":{"text":"That's rude.","source_cn":"真是傲慢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67B0B26EEDF9AD86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1011711004:0":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> is right...","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x851493F466BB48D5","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> is right...","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> is right...","variant_male_record_index":"107927","variant_female_record_index":"107928","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1011711005:0":{"text":"The Graveborns linger between life and death, belonging neither to the dawn nor to the night, how can they possess the power of <style=\"highlight\">\"life\"</style>?","source_cn":"介于生与死之间，既不属于黎明，也不属于黑夜的亡者，怎么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31AE4D0209BCF0E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1011711006:0":{"text":"Corruption, life, resurrection...","source_cn":"腐化，生命，复苏……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE1098346D5285199","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1011711007:0":{"text":"The trees surrounding the village, where corrupted roots entwine, wilt and wither.","source_cn":"腐化根茎生长的村庄，周围的树木纷纷枯萎。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14A4B3DB4EB6D124","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1011711008:0":{"text":"Meanwhile, the Graveborns who shouldn't have the ability to resurrect, keep coming back...","source_cn":"而本该没有复苏能力的亡者，却在不断复苏……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x534AF5F854921041","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1011711009:0":{"text":"I get it. You are stealing <style=\"highlight\">the life force of the Dark Forest</style>!","source_cn":"我明白了。\\n……你借用的是，<style=highl...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7F4183EB83F0637","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1011711010:0":{"text":"You mean, they draw life from the surroundings through the corrupted roots and channel it back into themselves?!","source_cn":"你、你的意思是，他们在靠腐化根茎抽取周围的生命，再把生...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB13543736711BB7D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1011711011:0":{"text":"Precisely. This is why Eomir sought to join forces with the Adamant Syndicate and corrupt the Lucent Tree...","source_cn":"没错。伊米尔和黑金商会合作，妄图腐化流荧树的动机，原来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x963A92018E14D542","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1011711012:0":{"text":"He is planning to seize the gift bestowed upon the forest by Misarte—a long and enduring <style=\"highlight\">life</style>!","source_cn":"为了从流荧树那里夺取弥萨忒赐予丛林的礼物——漫长而悠久...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C41F8FE038A92FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:17:1011711012":{"text":"He is planning to seize the gift bestowed upon the forest by Misarte—a long and enduring <style=\"highlight\">life</style>!","source_cn":"为了从流荧树那里夺取弥萨忒赐予丛林的礼物——漫长而悠久的——<style=highlight>生命</style>！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C41F8FE038A92FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1011711013:0":{"text":"How come you don't seem surprised at all by this conclusion...?","source_cn":"你……你怎么一点也不惊讶？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2F9D6C56C9D2ACC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1011711014:0":{"text":"Well, it seems that occasionally, there are some bright minds among the living.","source_cn":"何必惊讶，生者里偶尔也会有聪明人，并非不可预料。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x378E28D1593FDC09","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1011711015:0":{"text":"Well, let me continue savoring your struggle...","source_cn":"好了，让我继续欣赏你们的挣扎吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x99D0AE0AB664C939","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:21:1011711015":{"text":"Well, let me continue savoring your struggle...","source_cn":"好了，让我继续欣赏你们的挣扎吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x99D0AE0AB664C939","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1011711016:0":{"text":"Come now, you think I'd use my full strength against weaklings like you?","source_cn":"哦……？那又如何。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFBFEB7E4F151B385","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1011711017:0":{"text":"Hold on. I hear something...\nI hear the sound carried by the wind.","source_cn":"……有声音。\\n我听到了……风送来的声音。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E5EA9A0F6EFF3B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1011711018:0":{"text":"Eomir is leading the Thorned Guards to the Lucent Tree. He intends to implore Misarte for divine blessings, asking for the eradication of all corruption!","source_cn":"伊米尔正在率领荆棘卫队前往流荧树……说要在流荧树下向弥...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70D3134D2095AF47","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:25:1011711018":{"text":"Eomir is leading the Thorned Guards to the Lucent Tree. He intends to implore Misarte for divine blessings, asking for the eradication of all corruption!","source_cn":"伊米尔正在率领荆棘卫队前往流荧树……说要在流荧树下向弥萨忒祈祷，让祂降下能一举清除所有腐化的祝福！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70D3134D2095AF47","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1011711019:2":{"text":"We've been tricked!","source_cn":"……我们中计了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE95D1451EC61EE6A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1011711020:0":{"text":"She's here to hold us back so that Eomir can corrupt the Lucent Tree!","source_cn":"她在这里绊住我们，是为了能让伊米尔趁机举行腐化流荧树的仪式！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A892A1958A8D541","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1011711021:0":{"text":"I do appreciate smart individuals...","source_cn":"我确实欣赏聪明人……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF40C6519E482CE1A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1011711022:0":{"text":"But as mere mortals, it's better for you to be dumb!","source_cn":"但作为生者，还是愚钝些好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50F3BBC003CCE221","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1011711023:0":{"text":"Watch out! She's about to attack!","source_cn":"——大家小心，她又要发动攻击了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E2DF5DFD865A10E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:37:1011712001:":{"text":"Hm...","source_cn":"唔……<key:dialog1>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22376DD31D73C80D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:37:1011712002:":{"text":"Parisa's teleportation spell...","source_cn":"帕瑞莎的传送术……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3A3DF2CBAB1AE172","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Parisa's teleportation spell...","female":"Parisa's teleportation spell...","variant_male_record_index":"107949","variant_female_record_index":"107950","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:37:1011712003:":{"text":"Let flowers unfold beneath the Lucent Tree!","source_cn":"繁花，在流荧树下盛开吧！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x74536C723A859A60","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Let flowers unfold beneath the Lucent Tree!","female":"Let flowers unfold beneath the Lucent Tree!","variant_male_record_index":"107951","variant_female_record_index":"107952","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:39:10117111:0":{"text":"Eironn intercepted Cecia's attack! Seizing the opportunity, you use Parisa's teleportation magic to whisk everyone away to the Lucent Tree.","source_cn":"埃隆及时